{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36938","headline":"旅舍书怀寄所知二首 一 · 罗隐","name":"旅舍书怀寄所知二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"思量前事不堪寻，牢落余情满素琴。\n四海岂无腾跃路，一家长有别离心。\n道从汩没甘雌伏，迹恐因循更陆沈。\n寂寞谁应吊空馆，异乡时节独沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}